{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4010350/extras/81d20f301ded36a5da20256e4c5062ed.poster.avif?t=1761747247\" width=1170 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4010350/extras/81d20f301ded36a5da20256e4c5062ed.webm?t=1761747247\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4010350/extras/81d20f301ded36a5da20256e4c5062ed.mp4?t=1761747247\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by survival horror classics like 'Slender Man', <strong>IT LURKS</strong> throws you into the depths of a rotting sewer system with something that hunts you in the dark, able to hear even the faintest breath.  Scavenge for scarce supplies to stay alive, all while searching for vital data cards and uploading them to the surface for analysis.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4010350/extras/7240c7a983ba98f7b78ac7b17e4bb160.avif?t=1761747247\" width=1560 height=240 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Data Collection</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hunt for vital data tapes hidden throughout a sprawling sewer system and find a way to upload them. With a severely limited inventory, every expedition requires careful planning and multiple trips, each one taking you deeper into the labyrinth</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Survival Under Pressure</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some horrors linger in the shadows, and certain creatures are best not seen. Getting too close or lingering too long can have deadly consequences.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Limited Inventory\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carry only what\u2019s essential, every slot matters. Every choice could be a matter of life or death.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Immersive VHS Horror</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a decaying world brought to life with retro visuals and sound design that heighten the unease.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4010350/extras/bcbe98a4c25dc95889e942c428c49d5e.avif?t=1761747247\" width=1560 height=240 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are part of a specialised response team sent to investigate a mysterious infestation deep underground. The mission is too dangerous for full deployment, so you are sent in alone, armed only with a dim headlamp. There are no maps, no backup, and every tunnel could hold unexpected dangers. Tools and supplies are scattered along the way, left behind by crews who never returned.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you push deeper, fragments of the facility\u2019s archive await, revealing the truth piece by piece. But you are not alone. One predator stalks the tunnels... silent, intelligent, and relentless. Every sound you make, every corner you turn, could draw it closer. Survival depends on your skill, your wits, and your ability to stay one step ahead of the hunter in the shadows.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Eye See You","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4010350/9ec8c3b25b5d3c00c85b67ae752fc231e3b7b9ca.jpg"},{"name":"Terminal Explorer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4010350/c580e1825c4dde16615fc41201b984e5204e550f.jpg"}],"total":2},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4010350?t=1761747247","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4010350/56d247f0c5f79260dae7f66aac139d2ce0eed65b/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761747247","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4010350/d1809159d85d468e06eb54d14d83a0a95934fc9a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761747247","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4010350/d1809159d85d468e06eb54d14d83a0a95934fc9a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761747247","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Contains mild violence, blood, and horror themes. It includes disturbing imagery, psychological horror, gore, and intense scenes that may be unsettling to some players."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4010350/extras/81d20f301ded36a5da20256e4c5062ed.poster.avif?t=1761747247\" width=1170 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4010350/extras/81d20f301ded36a5da20256e4c5062ed.webm?t=1761747247\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4010350/extras/81d20f301ded36a5da20256e4c5062ed.mp4?t=1761747247\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by survival horror classics like 'Slender Man', <strong>IT LURKS</strong> throws you into the depths of a rotting sewer system with something that hunts you in the dark, able to hear even the faintest breath.  Scavenge for scarce supplies to stay alive, all while searching for vital data cards and uploading them to the surface for analysis.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4010350/extras/7240c7a983ba98f7b78ac7b17e4bb160.avif?t=1761747247\" width=1560 height=240 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Data Collection</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hunt for vital data tapes hidden throughout a sprawling sewer system and find a way to upload them. With a severely limited inventory, every expedition requires careful planning and multiple trips, each one taking you deeper into the labyrinth</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Survival Under Pressure</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some horrors linger in the shadows, and certain creatures are best not seen. Getting too close or lingering too long can have deadly consequences.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Limited Inventory\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carry only what\u2019s essential, every slot matters. Every choice could be a matter of life or death.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Immersive VHS Horror</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a decaying world brought to life with retro visuals and sound design that heighten the unease.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4010350/extras/bcbe98a4c25dc95889e942c428c49d5e.avif?t=1761747247\" width=1560 height=240 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are part of a specialised response team sent to investigate a mysterious infestation deep underground. The mission is too dangerous for full deployment, so you are sent in alone, armed only with a dim headlamp. There are no maps, no backup, and every tunnel could hold unexpected dangers. Tools and supplies are scattered along the way, left behind by crews who never returned.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you push deeper, fragments of the facility\u2019s archive await, revealing the truth piece by piece. But you are not alone. One predator stalks the tunnels... silent, intelligent, and relentless. Every sound you make, every corner you turn, could draw it closer. Survival depends on your skill, your wits, and your ability to stay one step ahead of the hunter in the shadows.</p>","developers":["Alex Le Mesurier"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4010350/4c936fb6714d8a82a3e691ce62cabaf763db0541/header.jpg?t=1761747247","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4010350/333103262/1ae8ab31b86a44182841980d5da41f15231cee83/1760222698/dash_av1.mpd?t=1760259247","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4010350/333103262/1ae8ab31b86a44182841980d5da41f15231cee83/1760222698/dash_h264.mpd?t=1760259247","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4010350/333103262/1ae8ab31b86a44182841980d5da41f15231cee83/1760222698/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1760259247","id":257216217,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257216217/movie480.mp4?t=1760259247","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257216217/movie_max.mp4?t=1760259247"},"name":"Short Gameplay Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257216217/7d5f831b731b730a803449020b2b918d85373a5c/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1760259247","webm":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257216217/movie480.webm?t=1760259247","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257216217/movie_max.webm?t=1760259247"}}],"name":"IT LURKS","package_groups":[{"description":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","name":"default","save_text